ue pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halflings</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"established\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Established</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">218</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Krenadir\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Krenadir\">Inhabitants of  Krenadir</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6TG9jYXRpb25zX2luX0tyZW5hZGlyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Category:Locations in Krenadir (page does not exist)\">Locations in  Krenadir</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Krenadir\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Krenadir\">Organizations in  Krenadir</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Krenadir&amp;DPL_cat2=Roads&amp;action=purge\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Roads  in  Krenadir</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6RXZlbnRzX2luX0tyZW5hZGlyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Category:Events in Krenadir (page does not exist)\">Events in  Krenadir</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6Rm9vZF9hbmRfZHJpbmtfZnJvbV9LcmVuYWRpcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Category:Food and drink from Krenadir (page does not exist)\">Food and drink from  Krenadir</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SXRlbXNfZnJvbV9LcmVuYWRpcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Category:Items from Krenadir (page does not exist)\">Items from  Krenadir</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Krenadir</b><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-tGHotR-p67_4-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tGHotR-p67-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> (also seen as <b>Krenalir</b><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-Map-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>) was a coastal city in the <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">halfling</a> realm of <a href=\"/wiki/Luiren\" title=\"Luiren\">Luiren</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-Map-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p48_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p48-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Armed_Forces\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Armed Forces</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Krenadir?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Krenadir was located on the coast of <a href=\"/wiki/Luirenstrand\" title=\"Luirenstrand\">Luirenstrand</a>  in the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Sea\" title=\"Great Sea\">Great Sea</a>. It was located some miles east of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Mortick_Swamp\" title=\"Mortick Swamp\">Mortick Swamp</a>. A road around the swamp connected the city to Beluir and the rest of Luiren.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-Map-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Krenadir?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Krenadir was founded in <a href=\"/wiki/218_DR\" title=\"218 DR\">218 DR</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-tGHotR-p67_4-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tGHotR-p67-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> In <a href=\"/wiki/1105_DR\" title=\"1105 DR\">1105 DR</a>, the city received widespread damage from a storm over the Great Sea.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-GHR-119_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GHR-119-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Armed_Forces\">Armed Forces</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Armed Forces\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Krenadir?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Armed Forces\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>During the height of the harvest season 100 <a href=\"/wiki/Warders\" title=\"Warders\">warders</a> protected the city and surrounding land. Many of these Warder's were laid-off during the winter season and spent their time patrolling the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Long_Forest\" title=\"Long Forest\">Long Forest</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Fasruil\" title=\"Fasruil\">Fasruil</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Crimel\" title=\"Crimel\">Crimel</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SS2ed-p48_2-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS2ed-p48-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Krenadir?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Krenadir?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS3e-Map-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_1-3\">1.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Map included in <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skip_Williams\" title=\"Skip Williams\">Skip Williams</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Heinsoo\" title=\"Rob Heinsoo\">Rob Heinsoo</a> (June 2001). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_3rd_edition\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>). ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\">0-7869-1836-5</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-SS2ed-p48-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS2ed-p48_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_re